<title>USA: Varian Associates buys.</title>
<headline>Varian Associates buys.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Varian Associates Inc said it bought the nuclear magnetic resonance (NMR) instrument assets of Otsuka Electronics USA of Ft. Collins, Colo.</p>
<p>The purchase price was not disclosed.</p>
